---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - WordSolver" description="Terms of service for WordSolver. Understand the rules and conditions for using our free color puzzle solver and daily answer tools.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container">
    <span class="hero-badge">Legal</span>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last updated: January 2025</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="container" style="padding-bottom:3rem;">
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By using WordSolver (wordsolver.tech), you agree to these terms of service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, do not use the site. These terms apply to all visitors and users of the site, including the daily answer pages, solver tools, and unlimited play modes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Description of Service</h2>
      <p>WordSolver provides free tools for color puzzle games, including daily answer pages, interactive solvers, and unlimited practice modes. The site is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind. We make no guarantees about the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of the daily answers, solver results, or game mechanics. The tools use the same algorithms the official games use, but we cannot guarantee 100% accuracy if the games change their logic without notice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>No Affiliation</h2>
      <p>WordSolver is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to Colordle, Colorfle, or any other puzzle game. We are an independent project built by players for players. All game names, trademarks, and logos belong to their respective owners. Our use of game names is for descriptive purposes only — to identify which game our tools are designed to help with.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>You may use WordSolver for personal, non-commercial purposes. Do not use automated scripts to scrape the site, overload our servers, or redistribute our content without permission. Do not attempt to reverse-engineer the site's code for competitive purposes. The solvers and tools are free — there is no reason to abuse them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>WordSolver and its operators are not liable for any damages arising from the use of this site, including but not limited to incorrect answers, solver errors, or loss of game progress. The site is a hobby project maintained in good faith. If a daily answer is wrong or a solver produces unexpected results, your recourse is to stop using the tool and solve the puzzle yourself.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms. The "last updated" date at the top of this page indicates when the terms were last modified. If you have questions, email hello@wordsolver.tech.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
